  "content": {
    "en": "Smooth UI is an open-source, animation-centric collection of React components developed by Eduard Constantin. Leveraging Framer Motion and Tailwind CSS, each component is fine-tuned to eliminate abrupt transitions, ensuring that layout changes feel organic and tactile.",
    "zh": "Smooth UI 是由 Eduard Constantin 主理的以极致平滑动效为核心卖点的开源 React 组件库。深度运用 Framer Motion 与 Tailwind CSS，消除了任何生硬突兀的视觉跳变，使得弹出层展开、卡片悬浮与页面切换如水流般自然顺畅。"
  },
